\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl276\slmult1\kerning2\b\f0\fs24\lang16393 Microsoft Agent Framework (MAF) \par
Microsoft Agent Framework (MAF)\b0  is Microsoft's unified, open-source framework for building, orchestrating, deploying, and managing AI agents and multi-agent systems. It combines the enterprise-grade capabilities of \b Semantic Kernel\b0  with the advanced multi-agent orchestration patterns pioneered by \b AutoGen\b0 , providing a production-ready platform for agentic AI applications. \par
In simple terms:\par
If LLMs are the "brains", Microsoft Agent Framework is the "operating system" that allows multiple AI agents to reason, collaborate, access tools, remember information, execute workflows, and perform real-world tasks safely at enterprise scale. \par
