\b 2. Harness Agent\par
\b0 One of MAF's unique concepts is the \b Harness Agent\b0 .\par
Think of it as a ready-made autonomous executive agent.\par
Capabilities include:\par

\pard{\pntext\f6\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf6\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1 Long-running tasks\par
