{\pntext\f6\'B7\tab}To-do tracking\par
{\pntext\f6\'B7\tab}Context compaction\par
{\pntext\f6\'B7\tab}Memory handling\par
{\pntext\f6\'B7\tab}Observability\par
{\pntext\f6\'B7\tab}Tool approvals\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl276\slmult1 Instead of manually building orchestration logic, developers can use Harness Agent as a production-ready foundation\par
\par
\par
\b 3. Workflows\par
\b0 Workflows provide deterministic execution.\par
Where agents are dynamic and probabilistic, workflows are controlled and repeatable.\par
