\b Microsoft Foundry Agent Service \par
Microsoft Agent Framework (MAF)\b0 , is the \b SDK/runtime for building agents\b0 .\b Microsoft Foundry Agent Service\b0 , is the \b managed cloud platform that runs, hosts, monitors, scales, secures, and governs those agents in production\b0 . Microsoft positions these together as the foundation for enterprise-grade agentic applications.\par
\b What is Microsoft Foundry Agent Service?\par
Foundry Agent Service\b0  is a fully managed service inside \b Microsoft Foundry\b0  for creating, deploying, orchestrating, monitoring, and governing AI agents. Instead of developers manually building:\par

